  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://csbc.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Central Selection Board of Constable (CSBC)</a> </span>has released the Exam Date, Admit Card &amp; Exam City Details for the post of Constable posts in Prohibition, Jail Warder, and Mobile Squad units. This recruitment was released for 4236 posts. Applications for the Bihar Police CSBC Prohibition Constable Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 06 October 2025 to 05 November 2025. The written examination is going to be conducted on 14 &amp; 17 June 2026. Candidates who have applied for this recruitment can download their Bihar Police CSBC Prohibition Constable Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Central Selection Board of Constable (CSBC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar Police Prohibition Constable Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Police CSBC Constable Advt No. : 03/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : 