12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed the 10+2 (Intermediate) exam from any recognized board in India are eligible.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.4461%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Jail Warder</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.5539%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed the 10+2 (Intermediate) exam from any recognized board in India are eligible.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.4461%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Mobile Squad Constable</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.5539%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed the 10+2 (Intermediate) exam from any recognized board in India are eligible.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Driving License Criteria : </strong>Candidates must have valid License of LMV/HMV for Vehicle Driving As on 26/September/2025. &amp; along with Candidates must have good knowledge of Traffic Rule &amp; Vehicle Repairing.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar Police CSBC Constable Job 2025 : Physical Eligibility Test</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Category</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Male</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Female</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Height</